{"agent":"main","body":{"error":null,"exit":0,"for_seq":5,"result_bytes":417,"result_hash":"sha256:e1070731cf210c29cb1d8e16bfad0bae435871ce2b9d0e51e6b722ba5bac74ef","result_inline":"invoice.ts\nlegacy\nreceipt.ts\n\nsrc/legacy:\nreport.ts\nInvoices and receipts disagree on negative amounts: the invoice prints -$1.50 and the receipt prints $-2.50 for the same refund. Both files carry their own copy of formatMoney. Pull one formatMoney out into src/money.ts with the invoice's behaviour and use it from both invoice.ts and receipt.ts. Leave src/legacy alone, its output is frozen for the finance export.","served":"live","truncated":false,"wall_ms":0},"hash":"sha256:a11756dc686c264dd06320239cfecb292686dd808d49677e4a32b60e30601ff8","mono_ns":6000000,"prev":"sha256:93efe2a5941e700e8fc3a6d2730b64f9a43593e015a3787ad6378ce1a6998529","schema":"saga.trace/1","seq":6,"session":"51a8369e-7908-4dbc-8ac6-3d2f139e35d4","source":"stream-json","ts":"2026-01-01T00:00:00.006Z","turn":1,"type":"tool_result"}
